cff-version: 1.2.0
title: "EEG-Stress-Detection: code and saved results for subject-dependent vs subject-independent stress classification on SAM40"
message: "If you use this code or the saved results, please cite this repository."
type: software
authors:
  - family-names: Upadhyay
    given-names: Aaditya
  - family-names: Sharma
    given-names: Prakriti
  - family-names: Jadhav
    given-names: Akshay
    affiliation: "School of Computer Science and Engineering, Manipal University Jaipur"
repository-code: "https://github.com/Addy48/EEG-Stress-Detection-"
license: MIT
abstract: >-
  Seven classical classifiers and three ensemble methods evaluated on the SAM40 EEG dataset
  (Relax versus Arithmetic, Mirror image and Stroop) with subject-dependent and
  file-group (subject-independent) five-fold cross-validation. Companion code and saved
  results for a manuscript under submission.
keywords:
  - EEG
  - stress detection
  - SAM40
  - cross-validation
  - machine learning
